Ansvar Compliance Skills plugin — third-party / upstream attribution
=====================================================================

This plugin bundles no original skill content. Every file under skills/ is
a byte-identical vendored copy of SKILL.md from a canonical, independently
published, independently licensed Ansvar Systems AB repository. The plugin
adds only packaging: the plugin manifest, the MCP server declaration, and
the anti-drift CI gate that keeps the copies honest.

